The deployed whiteboard is [Excalidraw](https://github.com/excalidraw/excalidraw),
Copyright (c) 2020 Excalidraw, released under the MIT License.

This repository contains the deployment configuration (Wrangler + Cloudflare
Access) for a self-hosted Excalidraw static build. The application bundle in
`build/` is generated by `build.sh` from the pinned Excalidraw source commit
(see README.md) and carries Excalidraw's MIT license.

